# Reeborg's World - Maze

A Python solution for the Maze challenge from Reeborg's World.

## Concepts

- Functions
- While loops
- If / elif / else
- Boolean conditions
- Problem solving
- Right-hand wall following

## Solution

The robot follows the right wall of the maze until it reaches the goal.

## Challenge

[Reeborg's World - Maze](https://reeborg.ca/reeborg.html?lang=en&mode=python&menu=worlds%2Fmenus%2Freeborg_intro_en.json&name=Maze&url=worlds%2Ftutorial_en%2Fmaze1.json)
